        a: "For the Skilled Worker stream, the core requirements are: a full-time, indeterminate job offer in NOC TEER 0 to 3 from an eligible B.C. employer; a wage in line with B.C. rates for that occupation; at least two years of full-time (or equivalent) skilled work experience in the last ten years; being qualified for the job, including any licence or registration it needs; meeting the minimum family income requirement; and valid language test results. Your employer must have operated in B.C. for at least a year and have at least five full-time employees in Metro Vancouver, or three elsewhere. Your occupation must not be on the ineligible list.",
