        q: "How do I check my BC PNP application status?",
        a: "Log in to your BCPNP Online account. Your dashboard shows whether your registration is active, whether you have been invited and the status of any application you have submitted. The BC PNP also sends invitations, document requests and decisions through the portal and by email, so check both regularly, including your spam folder, and answer requests before their deadline. Once you are nominated and apply for permanent residence, the federal stage is tracked separately, in your IRCC secure account or with IRCC's application status tracker.",
