        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/corporate/mandate/policies-operational-instructions-agreements/ministerial-instructions/express-entry-rounds.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">IRCC: Express Entry rounds of invitations</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/news/2026/10/canada-refocusing-express-entry-on-top-talent-that-drives-economic-growth.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">IRCC news release, October 16, 2026: Express Entry changes from November 3, 2026</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigrate-canada/provincial-nominees.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">IRCC: Provincial Nominee Program</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.nursingworld.org/our-certifications/pediatric-primary-care-nurse-practitioner/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">ANCC: Pediatric Primary Care Nurse Practitioner certification</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.pncb.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-600 underline">Pediatric Nursing Certification Board (PNCB)</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-4">Information current as of October 18, 2026. Program rules change often; confirm on IRCC or WelcomeBC before applying.</p>

    </div>

    <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-200">
